"secret of the X-Woow-Signature HMAC (never sent). Leave empty to keep the "
"current key; the saved key is never shown again. Changing the endpoint host "
"or the backend type removes the saved key, so it is never sent to another "
"server: enter it again."
msgstr ""
"OpenAI 相容：以「Authorization: Bearer」送出。n8n：X-Woow-Signature HMAC "
"的簽章金鑰（不會送出）。留空則保留目前的金鑰；儲存後不會再顯示。變更端點主機或後端類型會移除"
"已儲存的金鑰，避免送到另一台伺服器：請重新輸入。"

