msgstr "由系統參數 woow_ai_contact.job_runner = cron 指定。"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_contact/models/ai_contact.py:0
msgid "Forced by the system parameter woow_ai_contact.job_runner = thread."
msgstr "由系統參數 woow_ai_contact.job_runner = thread 指定。"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:woow_ai_contact.field_woow_ai_contact__job_runner_warning
msgid "Job Runner Warning"
msgstr "回覆處理警告"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_contact/models/ai_contact.py:0
msgid ""
"No cron runner was found: max_cron_threads is 0 in this server, or it runs "
"with --stop-after-init, and no other process ran the scheduled action "
"recently."
msgstr ""
"找不到排程工作執行者：本伺服器 max_cron_threads 為 0 或以 --stop-after-init 執行，而且最近沒有其他程序執行過這個排程動作。"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:woow_ai_contact.view_woow_ai_contact_form
msgid ""
"Replies are not processed by the cron runner on this server: see below."
msgstr "這台伺服器的回覆沒有交給排程工作（cron）處理：說明見下方。"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_contact/models/ai_contact.py:0
msgid ""
"Replies are processed in a background thread of the web worker that received"
" the message (fallback mode): a reply still running when that worker "
"restarts is cut and processed again."
msgstr "回覆在收到訊息的網頁程序背景執行緒處理（備援模式）：回覆進行中該網頁程序重啟時，回覆會被切斷並重新處理。"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_contact/models/ai_contact.py:0
msgid ""
"Replies are processed in the background by the scheduled action \"AI "
"Contacts: Run AI Replies\", outside the web workers (at most %(n)s "
"conversations at a time)."
msgstr "回覆由排程動作「AI 聯絡人：執行 AI 回覆」在背景處理，不佔用網頁程序（同時最多 %(n)s 段對話）。"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:woow_ai_contact.field_woow_ai_contact__job_runner_info
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:woow_ai_contact.view_woow_ai_contact_form
msgid "Reply Processing"
msgstr "回覆處理方式"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_contact/models/ai_contact.py:0
msgid ""
"The cron time limit (%(limit)s s) is shorter than the longest AI contact "
"timeout plus margins (%(required)s s). Set limit_time_real_cron to at least "
"%(required)s to process replies in the cron runner."
msgstr ""
"cron 時限（%(limit)s 秒）短於最長的 AI 聯絡人逾時加上餘裕（%(required)s 秒）。把 limit_time_real_cron 設為至少 %(required)s，回覆才會改由排程工作處理。"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:woow_ai_contact.field_woow_ai_contact__job_runner_info
msgid "Where the AI replies are processed (docs/DESIGN.md, job queue)."
msgstr "AI 回覆在哪裡處理（見 docs/DESIGN.md 的回覆佇列）。"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_contact/models/ai_contact.py:0
msgid "another process"
msgstr "其他程序"

#. module: woow_ai_contact
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/woow_ai_contact/models/ai_contact.py:0
msgid "this server"
msgstr "本伺服器"
